1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Although no source documents have been found connecting Gideon Spivy to Lizzie Baker, the descendants of Christina Baker (Lizzie's daughter) are 3-4th cousin DNA matches to the descendants of James Spivey &amp; Mary Smith. One of 
2 CONC their sons must have been the father of at least Christina if not also her siblings. John L. Spivey moved from Georgia to Texas around or before 1880 and the other sons are a little too young to have been Christina's father. While
2 CONC  it is possible that John L. , Isaac or GC could have been her father, it's more likely to have been Gideon due to age and proximity (Christine was born in Laurens County.)
