2 CONT John Stanley was born in 1675 in Mansfield, Nottinghamshire, England He was a son of Joseph Stanley and Anne Watson. John Standley is shown on the first United States Census as living in Mecklenburg, County, Virginia: 11 white, 6 
2 CONC black, on Lewis Parham's list 1782. He died in Henrico County, Virginia. John married Elizabeth Lockett, born in 1677 in Henrico, County, Virginia and died in 1708, in Henrico County, Virginia. Elizabeth's parents were Thomas Lock
2 CONC ett and wife, Margaret Osborne. Margaret's father was Thomas Osborne. John and Elizabeth Standley had a son, William Stanley, born in 1709 in North Carolina." Note; Mansfield, Nottinghamshire, England is an alternate birthplace.
2 CONT
