2 CONC ris 1745. Aetatis suae 68
2 CONT
2 CONT (Translation) Here lieth, the certain hope of being raised up in Christ, Thomas Nelson, Gentleman. Son of Hugh and Sarah Nelson, of Penrith, in the County of Cumberland. Born the 20th day of February, in the year of our Lord, 1677
2 CONC . He completed a well-spent life on the 7th day of October, 1745. Aged 68.
