1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sarah (Sally) Nelson Burwell''', daughter of Thomas Nelson & Frances Houston, was born in Yorktown, Va., about 1722; she married, about 1742, Colonel Robert Carter Burwell (of Isle of Wright County, Va.). He was
2 CONC  a brother of Elizabeth (called Betty) Burwell, wife of President William Nelson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children are:
2 CONT * 1. Nathaniel Burwell Nelson, of Lancaster County, Va., married Miss Mary Wormeley, of Middlesex County, Va..
2 CONT * 2. Frances Burwell (called Fannie) Page, first wife of Governor John Page.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
