1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Foster-8187
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 15 Dec 2021 | Created 3 Dec 2014
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sarah (Foster) Williams (abt. 1667 - 1751)===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Williams formerly Foster
2 CONT
2 CONT Born about 3 Jun 1667 in Roxbury, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Thomas Foster and Sarah (Parker) Brackett
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Thomas Foster, Hannah (Foster) Patten, Jonathan Foster and Elizabeth Foster
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Thomas Williams Jr. — married 22 Sep 1686 in Stow, MA
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Joseph Williams, Thomas Williams III, Anna Williams, Anna Williams, Isaiah Williams and Sarah Williams
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 8 Aug 1751 in Plainfield, Windham, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Foster was born 3 June 1667 in Roxbury, Suffolk Count, Province of Massachusetts Bay, to father Dr. Thomas Foster, and Sarah Parker.
2 CONT She was baptized 10 June 1666 (record reads, old style as 10: 4m: 1666. One of those dates is incorrect as to the year.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Capt. Thomas Williams, Jr., Sept 22, 1686, Stow, Middlesex County, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sometime after 1690 they moved to Plainfield, Windham County, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas died in 1722, age 52, in Plainfield, CT
2 CONT She passed away in 1751, age 83, Plainfield, Windham County, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was born about 1655.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ " Massachusetts: Vital Records, 1620-1850" (Online Database: AmericanAncestors.org, New England Historic Genealogical Society, 2001-2016). Volume: Roxbury, page 134. Subscription site.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Plainfield CT vital records
2 CONT https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/159715668/person/322105621193/facts
2 CONT See also:
2 CONT
2 CONT "Massachusetts Births and Christenings, 1639-1915", database, FamilySearch ([1] : 5 January 2021), Sarah Foster, 1667.
