1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sarah Jackson''', parents unidentified,  was born in England, and died date unknown in England.  She married Hugh Nelson on 1673 in Penrith, Cumbria, England, son of William Nelson.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Sarah Jackson and Hugh Nelson:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: 1673, Penrith, Cumbria, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sarah Jackson and Hugh Nelson are:
2 CONT # +Thomas Nelson, b. 20 Feb 1677, Penrith, , Cumberland, England1019, d. 07 Oct 1745, Yorktown, , Virginia, USA1019.  Married Margaret Reade.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Disputed origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT This Sarah Jackson married https://www.geni.com/people/Hugh-Nelson/6000000001169736061?through=6000000007039980180 in Penrith, Cumbria, assumed/presumed daughter of **Robert and **Ellen Hamblington, of Over, Middlewich, Cheshire, 
2 CONC two parishes many hundreds of miles from each other ( **These Jacksons are listed in Burke's Peerage and Baronetage). It was very rare for rural communities to look beyond their parishes for potential spouses. 
2 CONT
2 CONT There was a daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Jackson/6000000086009429843?through=6000000198380327864 Robert Jackson]  and [https://www.geni.com/people/Ellen-Jackson/6000000086009212992?through=6000000198380327864 El
2 CONC len Hamblington] of Over, Middlewich, Cheshire called [https://www.geni.com/people/Sarah-Jackson-died-young/6000000198380327864 Sarah], but she died before maturity. 
2 CONT
2 CONT This Sarah has been detached from those parents.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * "England Marriages, 1538–1973 ," database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:NXV1-Z6T : 10 February 2018), Hugh Nelson and Sarah Jackson, 05 Feb 1673; citing St. Andrew, Penrith, Cumberland, England, referenc
2 CONC e , index based upon data collected by the Genealogical Society of Utah, Salt Lake City; FHL microfilm 1,472,072.
2 CONT * http://www.genealogy.com/ftm/g/l/a/Benjamin-Glasgow/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0900.html
