1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Weems, b. 1704 in Bucks County, Pennsylvania first settled as an adult in Augusta County, VA. He later moved his family to the Old 96th District in Abbeville County, South Carolina where he lived and died in
2 CONC  the Long Cane Creek area just 5 miles south of the town of Abbeville.
