1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) John (John 1) born 1637 in England. Died Sept. 10, 1727. Married Bethiah Rootes, daughter of Josiah and Suzanna Rootes. During the witch- craft hysteria at Salem, Suzanna Rootes was accused of being a witch. She was arrested Ma
2 CONC y 21, 1692 and was convicted as guilty. Fortu- nately she was only imprisoned. The Lovetts lived at Beverly.
2 CONT
