2 CONC E OVER IN WITHROP'S FLEET. HE REQUESTED ADMISSION AS FREEMAN OCT. 19, 1630, AND WS SWORN MAY 19, 1631. IN 1631, HE AND JUDITH WERE COMMUNICANTS OF THE FIRST CHURCH OF ROXBURY. HE MAY HAVE BEEN THE YOUNGER BROTHER AND THE ROXBURY 
