2 CONT ===Experience (Foster) French (abt. 1645 - aft. 1729)===
2 CONT
2 CONT Experience French formerly Foster
2 CONT
2 CONT Born about 1645 in Weymouth, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Thomas Foster and Elizabeth (Unknown) Foster
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Thomas Foster, John Foster I, Elizabeth (Foster) Frost [half], Hopestill Foster and Joseph Foster
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Joseph French — married 4 Nov 1663 in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Thomas French, Joseph French, Experience (French) Chamberlain, Elizabeth (French) Phillips, Joseph French, John French, Nathaniel French, Sarah French, Jacob French, Thomas French, Ebenezer French and Nathan French
2 CONT
2 CONT Died after 1729 in Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 4 Jul 2020 | Created 19 May 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Experience Foster was born about 1645, probably at Weymouth, Massachusetts Bay.
