2 CONT 1677 Birth
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Foster was born in 1677 in Cranston, Providence County, Rhode Island. . [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT 1713 Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1713 she married John Stone (1674-1759) [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT 1760 Death
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1760 in Cranston, Providence County, Rhode Island. She is buried in the North Burial Ground in Providence, where her remains were moved from the Hugh Stone Family Lot CR027. Original stone inscription: "A. S. 1677-1760
2 CONC " (taken from earlier transcriptions before re-interment) [1]
