2 CONT 11. Henry Clay GIBSON. Born on 15 Sep 1859 in Montgomery Co., Texas. Henry Clay died in Montgomery Co., Texas on 16 Dec 1917, he was 58.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 25 Jan 1885 when Henry Clay was 25, he married Edna Lillian Duke TURNER, daughter of John TURNER & Elizabeth WARREN, in Montgomery Co., Texas.
2 CONT
