2 CONT
2 CONT Laura Mae says that she remembers Oliver Cromwell very well.  "We used to call him Uncle O.C."  He was a fine upstanding man, and well thought of in the community of Huntington, Tx.  He was a farmer who worked hard to support his 
2 CONC family".
