1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary Woody (daughter of Richard Woody and Ann Hayle)48, 48 was born 1628 in Suffolk, England48, 48, and died 30 Mar 1662 in Braintree, Norfolk, MA, USA48, 48.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Edmund Sheffield on 17 Apr 1644 in Roxbury, Suffolk, MA, USA48, 48.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===family===
2 CONT
2 CONT From  GENEALOGIES OF R.I.FAMILIES, VOL. II, ONE BRANCH OF THE RHODE ISLAND SHEFFIELDS, by G. Andrews Moriarty, A.M., LL.B., F.S.A., page 158.
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund settled in Braintree, Mass., where he died 13 Oct. 1705, "aged about 90 years". He had issue eleven (SIC: 12) children.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund married Mary WOODY, daughter of Richard WOODY, on 17 Apr 1644 in Roxbury, Essex Co., Mass.. Mary died 30 Mar 1662 in Braintree, Essex Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *       	11 	M 	i 	    	John SHEFFIELD was born 6 Mar 1644/1645 in Roxbury, Essex Co., Massachusetts and was christened 23 Mar 1645 in Roxbury, Essex Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT *       	12 	M 	ii 	    	Edmund SHEFFIELD was born 15 Dec 1646 in Braintree, Norfolk Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT *       	13 	F 	iii 	    	Ann SHEFFIELD was born 1 Apr 1649 in Braintree, Norfolk Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT *       	14 	F 	iv 	    	Mary SHEFFIELD was born 14 Jun 1653 in Braintree, Norfolk Co., Massachusetts. She died 7 Dec 1660 in Braintree, Norfolk Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT *       	15 	M 	v 	    	Matthew SHEFFIELD was born 26 May 1655 in Braintree, Norfolk Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT *       	16 	M 	vi 	    	Samuel SHEFFIELD was born 26 Nov 1657 in Braintree, Norfolk Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT *       	17 	F 	vii 	    	Sarah SHEFFIELD was born 6 Jun 1660 in Braintree, Norfolk Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Mary Woody:
2 CONT * Date born 2: England.
2 CONT * Date born 3: Abt. 1627, England.
2 CONT * Died 2: 1652, Braintree, MA.
2 CONT * Died 3: 30 Jun 1662, MA.
2 CONT * More About Mary Woody and Edmund Sheffield:
2 CONT * Marriage: 17 Apr 1644, Roxbury, Suffolk, MA, USA.48, 48
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund SHEFFIELD (Edmund ) was born 16 Aug 1612 in Sudbury, Suffolk, England. He died 13 Oct 1705 in Braintree, Norfolk Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT From    Sheffield, Daggett and Allied Families, by Mrs. George St. John Sheffield, page 13 & 14.
2 CONT *          He was a wheelwright by trade, and in 1641 settled in Roxbury, MA.
2 CONT *          He was made a freeman, May 29 1644. About 1646 he removed to Braintree, where he was one of the first settlers, and served as selectman in 1677-78.
2 CONT *          He was admitted to the First Church of Roxbury before 1650.
2 CONT *          Married 1st in England, a wife whose name is unknown, and who probably died in England.
2 CONT *          Daughter Elizabeth, baptized at All Saints, Sudbury, EN Mar. 12, 1635-6, probably died in England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations 
2 CONT *     C.M. Ellis: History of Roxbury, MA, pp. 31, 130.
2 CONT *     Vital Records of Roxbury MA, Vol. I, p. 318                              Vol. II, p. 363.
2 CONT *     Savage: Genealogy Dictionary of New England, Vol IV, p. 68.
2 CONT *     Vital Records of Braintree, MA, p. 894.
2 CONT *     Bates: Records of Braintree, MA, pp. 18, 171, 638, 694. 722.
2 CONT *     New England Historical and Genealogical Register, Vol. III, p. 190:            Vol. XI, p. 190.            Vol. XXXVI, p. 46-48, 300,                              p. 378-379.            Vol. LXXVII, p. 192.
2 CONT *     Pope: Pioneers of Massachusetts, p. 410.
2 CONT *     Moore: Genealogical Register of Inhabitants of Sherborn and Halliston, MA, p. 240.
2 CONT *     Vinton: Giles Memorial, pp. 349-350.
2 CONT *     History of Hilgham, MA, Vol. II, p. 54.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * The New England Historical and Genealogical Register, Volumes 76-77. Genealogical Gleanings in England [https://books.google.com/books?id=FpAeAQAAMAAJ&lpg=RA1-PA192&ots=S06hVx7Ogb&dq=thomasine%20sheffield&pg=RA1-PA193#v=onepage&
2 CONC q&f=true page 193]
