2 CONT William Bridges Born 3 Oct 1834 in Trigg County, Kentucky
2 CONT
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of William Bridges and Mary Polly (Thomas) Bridges
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Orren D. Bridges, Starkie T Bridges, Simco N Bridges, Drewry Bridges, Burnetta Bridges, James C. Bridges, Stanley Bridges, Mary Adeline (Bridges) Hixon, Charity (Bridges) Battoe, John Bridges and	Cullen Thomas Bridges
