2 CONT [spouse(s) unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT [children unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 22 Apr 1862 in Castillon Springs, Mississippi
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT "At age 27, enlisted in the Confederate Army; reported for duty September 14, 1861, Camp Burnett, Tennessee. Assigned Co. G, Fourth Regiment, Kentucky Brigade, served as (a) musician. Transferred to Co. I, January, 1862, saw servi
2 CONC ce at Ft. Donelson, Kentucky only 15 miles from home, later at Shiloh and Vicksburg." Died.....of illness, Castillon Springs. Mississippi, where he is buried."
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT The Thomas and Bridges Story, 1540-1840, By Edison H. Thomas
