2 CONT
2 CONT     Has No Children Ora Agnes BRIDGES b: 15 JUN 1869 in Trigg County, Kentucky
2 CONT
2 CONT     Has Children Mark Dale BRIDGES b: 07 NOV 1871 in Trigg County, Kentucky
2 CONT
2 CONT     Has Children John Trice BRIDGES b: 15 FEB 1874 in Maple Grove, Kentucky
2 CONT
2 CONT     Has Children Rosa Lee BRIDGES b: 29 JAN 1876 in Trigg County, Kentucky
2 CONT
