2 TITL Nelson House, circa 1730 Marker
1 NOTE !BIRTH - A GENEALOGY OF THE KNOWN DESCENDANTS OF ROBERT CARTER OF COROTOMAN compiled by Florence Tyler Carlton, p. 143
2 CONT Thomas Nelson, son of Elizabeth Burwell and William Nelson (President of the Council) was born in 1738 in Yorktown, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT !MAR - Ibid
2 CONT He married in 1762 Lucy Grymes, daughter of Philip and Mary (Randolph) Grymes.
2 CONT
2 CONT !DEATH - Ibid
2 CONT He died in 1789 in Yorktown, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT !BURIAL - Ibid
2 CONT He was buried in Grace Churchyard at Yorktown, VA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Nelson was a Signer of The Declaration of Independence and Governor of Virginia in 1781. - Ibid
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Nelson is a 2nd cousin, 4 generations removed to Robert B. Carter.
