1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/112742522/elizabeth-youel Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jun 12 2019, 19:46:44 UTC''
