2 CONC SON b: 1793 in Pagebrook, Charles City, VA Evelyn Byrd NELSON b: 1795 in Pagebrook, Charles City, VA Ann Rosalie NELSON b: 1796 in Pagebrook, Charles City, VA Alfred ^ NELSON b: 12 MAY 1803 in Louisa County, VA James Franklin NELS
