2 CONT William Combs (18812851)
2 CONT
2 CONT Suggested edit: In 1995 My Wife and I went to SE Kentucky to the Combs reunion. The researchers broke into to two groups. We had only 8 - 9 researchers in our group who were descendants of William Combs 1777 - 1841 while the other
2 CONC s group of 50 descended from the Brothers Eight of SE Kentucky. A lady in our group brought the Pension Papers from Edgar County Illinois by Sarah Ann Million Combs 1756 - 1843. What we learned was completely different from Chapte
2 CONC r XX in the Combs Book. We were given the information that your William Combs born 1740 was the husband of Sarah Ann Million. The first thing we found why would a man born in 1740 wait to marry in 1775. Sarah Ann Combs in her pens
2 CONC ion papers said that she was married only once and her husband died during the War. He never returned home from the Continental War in which he enlisted under Billy Washington Brother to George Washington. William Combs @1755 - 17
2 CONC 82 the husband was wounded in the Battle of Brandywine. He remained in the Northern area in the invalid core under Col. Nicholas guarding Stores and Warehouses. She stated that their only Son was born in 1777. Your 1740 William Co
2 CONC mbs lived to 1815 from a deed found in Virginia. We guess he did not die in the War.
2 CONT
2 CONT We are sure you are sitting down now. By 1997 DNA was the rage in genealogy. We found two descendants of different Sons of William Combs 1777 and their DNA matched but they did not match William Combs 1740 - 1815 whose ancestors a
2 CONC re Mason and Archdale. By 2004 We have now four different Sons of William Combs 1777 matching each other.
2 CONT
2 CONT My Wife and I have spent 24 years in correcting the errors of The Combs Book chapter XX. We hope you will honor our common ancestor Sarah Ann Million Combs who is buried just 35 miles from are home in Illinois. 
2 CONT She deserves your support as you descend from her and her Husband Sergeant William Combs @1755 - 1782.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gravesite Details
2 CONT no dates
2 CONT ----
