2 CONT '''Ann Dennis Stacy (Combs)''' was born on March 28, 1743 in Stafford County, Virginia, Colonial America. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-25028768 Mason Combs, I] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-25028876 Sarah Ann
2 CONC  Combs (unknown)]. 
