2 CONT b. ?1683, 2nd s. of Arthur Champernowne of Dartington by Margaret, da. and eventually coh. of Sir John Fowell, 2nd Bt., M.P., of Fowelscombe, Devon, sis. of Sir John Fowell, 3rd Bt., M.P. educ. Exeter, Oxf. 2 Mar. 1702, aged 18. m
2 CONC . (1) Elizabeth (d. 1717), da. of Francis Courtenay of Powderham, Devon, 2s. 1da.; (2) Susannah, da. of John Kelland, M.P., wid. of (i) Moses Gould, and (ii) William Courtenay of Tretherffe. suc. e. bro. 1696. d. 27 Apr. 1717.
2 CONT
