2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ROBERT YANCEY - he is listed in many trees on ancestry.com as being father (along with Philadelphia as mother) of Elizabeth Parrot and several Griffin children.  were these adopted????)
2 CONT
2 CONT PARENTS: Richard and Mary (Bolling??) Yancey of Louisa and later Mecklenburg County, Virginia BN: about 1744 in Louisa County, Virginia DD: 1818 in Mecklenburg County, Virginia WIFE: PHILADELPHIA JONES married 1765-1768 in Virgini
2 CONC a
