2 CONT A Patriot of the American Revolution for GEORGIA with the rank of PRIVATE.  [https://services.dar.org/Public/DAR_Research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A130293   DAR Ancestor #: A130293]
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT John Miles, Jr. served along with his brother James in the Revolution under Colonel James McNeil from Columbia County, Georgia Both received certificates from Col. McNeil. The Militia Returns, 1754-1755, State Records of North Car
2 CONC olina by Clark, lists John Youngblood, Ensign, as a subaltern Officer, p 331-332.
2 CONT
2 CONT He received a grant of 300 acres of land on Little Kiokee Creek, in what is now Columbia County, Georgia 
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------
