2 CONT ##  "Massachusetts, Town Clerk, Vital and Town Records, 1626-2001," database with images, FamilySearch (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:Q29L-8JZV : 10 November 2020), Mary Lovet, 29 Nov 1695; citing Birth, Beverly, Ess
2 CONC ex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, Massachusetts Secretary of the Commonwealth, Boston; FHL microfilm 004029870.
2 CONT ## "Massachusetts, Town Clerk, Vital and Town Records, 1626-2001," database with images, FamilySearch (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:Q29L-PZ9D : 10 November 2020), Mary Lovett, 29 Nov 1695; citing Birth, Beverly, Ess
2 CONC ex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, Massachusetts Secretary of the Commonwealth, Boston; FHL microfilm 004934217.
