2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Bethia was born about 1682. She was christened in 4 Jun 1682. Her parents were John Lovett and Bethia (Rootes) Lovett. [1] [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Bethia was married to (1) Peter Shaw on 14 October 1705 in Beverly, Essex County, Massachusetts. [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Peter b 1706/7 [4] He was christened in 1708. [5]
2 CONT Bethiah b 1709. [6]
2 CONT Her first husband died about 1709.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married (2) Nehemiah Howard/Haward of Salem in 1711 in Beverly. [7]
2 CONT
2 CONT Two book sources for the 1711 Beverly marriage of Bethia Shaw and Nehemiah Haward of Salem:
2 CONT
2 CONT Beverly Marriages: Vital records of Beverly, Massachusetts, to the end of the year 1849 ... v.2 ; she is Bethia Shaw; he is Nehemiah Haward of Salem."
2 CONT Salem Marriages: Vital records of Salem, Massachusetts, to the end of the year 1849 v.3; she is Bethia Shaw of Beverly; he is Nehemiah Howard.
2 CONT In Bethia's father's will from 1723 John Lovit refers twice to the surname "Howard." First to "my Daughter Bethia Howard" and second, to "my [son] in Law Nehemiah Howard."
2 CONT
2 CONT Children, all 6 born or christened in Beverly Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Josiah Howard b 1712. [8]
2 CONT Jabez Hayward c 1714. [9]
2 CONT Elmira Hayward c 1717. [10]
2 CONT Eunice Hayward b 1717. [11]
2 CONT Andrew Hayward b 1719. [12]
2 CONT Rose Hayward b 1722. [13]
2 CONT Her death date is unknown.
2 CONT
