1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Thomas Woodbury
2 CONT * Gender: Male
2 CONT * Birth: July 3 1667  Beverly, Essex, Massachuesetts
2 CONT * Christening: May 5 1667   Salem, Essex, Massachusetts
2 CONT * Death: Aug 23 1698   Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts
2 CONT * Burial: Aug 23 1668  Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts
2 CONT * Parents: Thomas Woodbury & Hannah Dodge
2 CONT * Spouse: Abigail Lovett 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://uneeke1.tripod.com/d5.html#i23969
2 CONT
2 CONT 92. Thomas Woodbury was christened on 5 May 1667 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts, USA and died on 22 Aug 1698 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA at age 31. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: Thomas, s. ____, bp. 5: 3 m. 1667. C.R.1. Salem V.R. (Pg. #441).
2 CONT
2 CONT ESSEX COUNTY, MASSACHUSETTS, PROBATE INDEX, 1638-1840
2 CONT
2 CONT * File #30515 
2 CONT * Name: Thomas Woodbury; 
2 CONT * Date: 22 Aug 1698 
2 CONT * Residence: Beverly 
2 CONT * Occupation: Husbandman 
2 CONT * Type: Intestate
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas married Abigail Lovett.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: First Church Records of Beverly list Abigail as LOVETT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT # 394 M   Simon Woodbury was born on 16 Jan 1688 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA and died in Feb 1688 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA. Notes: Simon, s. Thomas and Abigaile (Lovett), b. Jan. 16 1687-8. Beverly V.R. (Pg.
2 CONC  #391). Simon, s. Thomas and Abygaile, d. Feb. 26, 1687-8, a. abt. 6 w. Beverly V.R. (Pg. #618).
2 CONT #395 M  Samuel Woodbury was born on 7 May 1689 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA, was christened on 27 Sep 1691 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA, and died from Mar 1761 to 1762 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA at age
2 CONC  71. Notes: Samuell, s. Thomas [jr. C.RI] and Abigaile (Lovett), May 7, 1689. Beverly V.R. (Pg. #391). Samuel, bp. Sept. 27, 1691, 1st Church Records, Beverly, MA Essex Historical Collection Vol. #37; Pg. #200.Sam[ue]l, ____, 1762
2 CONC , a. 74 y. P.R.1. Beverly V.R. (Pg. #613).
2 CONT #392 F  Jemima Woodbury <twin> was christened on 27 Sep 1691 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA and died on 29 Mar 1704 in Wenham, Essex, Massachusetts, USA at age 12. Notes: Jemima, d. Thomas, jr., bp. 27 : 7m : 1691. C.RI Bev
2 CONC erly V.R. (Pg. #393). Jemina, d. Mar 29, 1704, Wenham V.R. (Pg. #225).
2 CONT #393 F Kezia Woodbury <twin> was christened on 27 Sep 1691 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA. 
2 CONT # 396 F Mary Woodbury was born on 26 Jan 1698 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA and was christened on 26 Jun 1698 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA. 
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT From Essex Institute Historical Collections, Volume 58 “Larcum.” Page 132-133 [https://books.google.com/books?id=nRkRAAAAYAAJ&lpg=PA42&ots=aR6E1Nt619&dq=Mordecai%20Larcum&pg=PA133#v=onepage&q&f=true GoogleBooks]
2 CONT
2 CONT >On Aug. 19, 1718, Abigail Larcom, widow of Thomas Larkum, late of Beverly, husbandman, sells four and a half acres of land to her son-in-law, John Masury, who had married her daughter by her first husband, Keziah Woodbery.
2 CONT
