1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kezia Woodbury, daughter of Thomas Woodbury & Abigail Lovett, married John Masury Jr., son of John Masury and Mary Larcom, on 9 Dec 1714 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA. John was born on 28 Apr 1694 in Salem,
2 CONC  Essex, Massachusetts, USA. Their children were John & Susanna.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://uneeke1.tripod.com/d6.html#i12779
2 CONT
2 CONT 393. Kezia Woodbury <twin> was christened on 27 Sep 1691 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: Kezia, d. Thomas, jr. bp. 27 : 7m : 1691 C.RI Beverly V.R. (Pg. #393).
2 CONT Kezziah, and John Masury [Majury. int.] of Salem, m. Dec. 9, 1714.* Beverly V.R. (Pg. #352).
2 CONT
2 CONT Kezia married John Masury Jr., son of John Masury and Mary Larcom, on 9 Dec 1714 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA. John was born on 28 Apr 1694 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: John, and Kezziah Woodberry of Beverly, at Beverly, Dec. 9, 1714.* Beverly V.R. (Pg. #73). John and Keshiah Masury were married by Reverend Thomas Blowers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT *   1318 M    i. John Masury was born on 27 Sep 1715 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts, USA and died on 28 Sep 1797 at age 82. Notes: John, s. John, jr. and Kezia, b. Sept. 27, 1715. Salem V.R. (Pg. #74).John, and Mary Bush, m. Apr. 
2 CONC 19, 1739. Salem V.R. (Pg. #73). John, and Elizabeth Bagnal, at Danvers, July 26, 1775. John [m., blind with age. CR4], Sept. 28, 1797, a. 82 y. Salem V.R. (Pg. #60). 390. Sept. 30. John Masury, blind with age, set. 82. 1st marriag
2 CONC e, thirty-five years ; 2nd marriage, twenty-one years. .Has left a wife and three children, one son. Both wives only children of brothers Bush ; 2nd wife married Phippen, Bagnall, then Masury. He has been blind seven years. Follow
2 CONC ed the seas and bedridden from a fall.  PARISH LIST OF DEATHS. 1785-1819. by REV. WILLIAM BENTLEY, East Parish Church, Salem, Massachusetts; Page 38.  John married Mary Bush on 19 Apr 1739. Mary died in 1774. John next married Eli
2 CONC zabeth (Bush) Bagnal on 26 Jul 1775 in Danvers, Essex, Massachusetts, USA.
2 CONT *   1319 F    ii. Susanna Masury was christened on 4 May 1718 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, USA.  Notes: Susanna, bp. May 4, 1718, 1st Church Records, Beverly, MA Essex Historical Collection Vol. #38; Pg. #180.
2 CONT
