1 OCCU A maltster - a maker of malt, hence beer or ale.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} James Weeden (1) was born on 30 Jul 1585 in Chesham, Buckingham, Eng.. He died on 17 Dec 1673 in Portsmouth, Rhode Island. Immigrated to Newport, RI with family in 1638 on the ship "Martin". Moved to Portsmouth, RI
2 CONC  in 1651.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Martin's voyage is only known through the death of a passenger and his will.The Martin arrived in Boston Harbor before July 13, 1638.
2 CONT
2 CONT The following list is all that is known:
2 CONT
2 CONT >SYLVESTER BALDWIN of Aston Clinton, county Bucks. Or from Flitwick,Bedforfshire, bound for Norwich CT. 36 pg 2 & 7
2 CONT Mrs. Sarah Baldwin  Richard Baldwin  Sarah Baldwin 
2 CONT
2 CONT CHAD BROWN (settled in) Providence (From Wycombe (High) bound for Providence. Ref: NEGR 65/84. 36 pg 11)  Mrs. Elizabeth Brown  John Brown 
2 CONT
2 CONT JAMES WEEDEN of Chesham, county Bucks (settled in) Newport, Rhode Island  (Weedon from Chesham, Buckinghamshire, bound for Newport, RI. Ref: NEGR 76/115 36 pg 8)  Mrs. Phillippa Weeden  John Weeden  William Weeden  Anna Weeden  Ma
2 CONC rtha Weeden 
2 CONT
2 CONT Martin sources:http://members.aol.com/dcurtin1/gene/martin38.htm
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/people/James-Weeden/6000000000312280366 '''James Weeden'''] (1585 - circa 1673) is [https://www.geni.com/path/John-Weedon+is+related+to+James-Weeden?from=6000000007395992651&to=6000000000312280366 '''John Wee
2 CONC don's'''] fifth great grandson.
2 CONT
2 CONT More information on the project   [https://www.geni.com/projects/Descendants-of-John-Weeden/49252 '''Descendants of John Weeden''']<br/>
2 CONT  If it interests you please join and be a contributor.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''EIGHTH GENERATION'''<br/>
2 CONT 18. [http://www.weedin.com/genes/d716.html#P716 '''James Weeden'''] (1) was born on 30 Jul 1585 in Chesham, Buckingham, Eng.. He died on 17 Dec 1673 in Portsmouth, Rhode Island. Immigrated to Newport, RI with family in 1638 on the
2 CONC  ship "Martin". Moved to Portsmouth, RI in 1651.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Phillipa Cocke on 1 Sep 1615 in Chesham, Buckingham, Eng.. Phillipa Cocke (1) was born on 14 Jan 1587 in Belindon, Chesham, Buckingham, Eng.. She died in 1648 in Portsmouth, Rhode Island. Daughter of William Cock
2 CONC (e) & Joan Belandon. James Weeden and Phillipa Cocke had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT #child26 i. Anna Weeden(1) was born in 1627 in Chesham, Buckingham, Eng.. She died after 1636. 
2 CONT #child27 ii. Martha Weeden(1) was born on 1 Jun 1632 in Chesham, Buckingham, Eng.. She died after 1636. 
2 CONT #child28 iii. John Weeden(1) was born on 15 Sep 1616 in Chesham, Buckingham, Eng.. He died on 9 Jan 1637. 
2 CONT #child29 iv. James Weeden(1) was born on 10 Feb 1624 in Chesham, Buckingham, Eng.. He died in 1702 in Newport, Rhode Island. Died unmarried. 
2 CONT #child30 v. Alice Weeden(1) was born on 26 Sep 1621 in Chesham, Buckingham, Eng.. She was buried on 2 Mar 1628 in Chesham, Buckingham, Eng.. 
2 CONT #child+31 vi. William Weeden.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Rose Grinnell in 1650 in Portsmouth, Rhode Island. Rose Grinnell (1) was born in 1595 in Lexden, Essex, England. She died in 1673 in Portsmouth, Rhode Island. This was Rose's 3rd marriage. Former surneams were Pa
2 CONC ine & French.
2 CONT
