1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/John-Stanley/6000000091772084988?through=6000000013061736107
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT == Summary ==
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Robert Stanley
2 CONT * Birth: say 1570 prob in Tenterden, Kent, England
2 CONT * Parents Unknown
2 CONT * Marriage 17 Dec 1588 in Tenteden, Kent to Ruth Garland
2 CONT * Death:  Jun. 1, 1605 in Tenterden, Kent, England
2 CONT *  Children: William, John, Thomas and Timothy (Note recent research does not find evidence that he was father to Ruth, Freegift and Patuence disclosed in older research included below) 
2 CONT
2 CONT For the most recent peer-reviewed research please see [https://www.americanancestors.org/databases/american-genealogist-the/image/?pageName=219&volumeId=13263 Leslie Mahler (2005) TAG 80:219] for the English Origins of this family
2 CONC  and the [https://www.americanancestors.org/databases/great-migration-immigrants-to-new-england-1634-1635-volume-vi-r-s/image/?pageName=455&filterQuery=category:Great%20Migration%20Study%20Project Great Migrations Vol 6 for three 
2 CONC of his sons: John Thomas and Timothy]
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert STANLEY married Ruth GARLAND 17d 12m 1588 at Heathfield, Tenterden Par, Kentshire, England and was buried 1d 6m 1605 at Tenterden, Tenterden Par, Kentshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT See: http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~stanfam/tenterden.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT for Gilliam Rickard has researched the origins of the three STALEY brothers who emmigrated to Connecticut: Thomas of Hartford, Timothy of Hartford, and John who died at sea in route to Connecticut. In the above link is a letter he
2 CONC  wrote to Roy Stanley which proves that the three brothers were the sons not of John & Susan (LANCOCK) STANLEY but the sons of Robert & Ruth (GARLAND) STANLEY. 
2 CONT
2 CONT This research has also been accepted by the noted genealogist Gary Boyd Roberts of the New England Historic Genealogical Society for see p. 461 of the 2009 edition of Ancestors of American Presidents showing Robert & Ruth (GARLAND
2 CONC ) STANLEY as the common ancestors of Presidents Grover CLEVELAND (a descendant of their son Thomas), President Gerald FORD (a descendant of their son John), and both Presidents BUSH (descendants of their son Timothy). 
2 CONT
