2 CONT
2 CONT Hartford Stanley Families
2 CONT  Scroll
2 CONT
2 CONT Gillian Rickard, B.A., Dip. Loc. Hist.
2 CONT  99 Strangers Lane, Canterbury, Kent CT1 3XN, England.
2 CONT  Email: GRKentGen@aol.com Web Site: www.kentgen.com
2 CONT  Kent Genealogical, Historical and Biographical Research.
2 CONT  (Established 1978).
