2 CONT     Has No Children Robart Stanley b: ABT 1596 in Tenterden Parish, Kent, England
2 CONT     Has Children John Stanley b: 8 OCT 1599 in Tenterden, Tenterden Parish, Kent, England
2 CONT     Has Children Thomas Stanley b: 22 APR 1601 in Tenterden, Tenterden Parish, Kent, England
2 CONT     Has Children Timothy STANLEY b: 22 MAR 1604 in Tenterden, Tenterden Parish, Kent, England
2 CONT
