2 CONT   Robert Stanley (____ - 1605)
2 CONT   Ruth Garland Stanley
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Elizabeth Morrice Bacon (1602 - 1678)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Elizabeth Stanley Saint John (1635 - 1692)*
2 CONT   Abigail Stanley Cowles (1637 - 1734)*
2 CONT   Caleb Stanly (1642 - 1718)*
2 CONT   Lois Stanley Porter (1645 - 1711)*
2 CONT   Isaac Stanley (1648 - 1671)*
2 CONT
