2 CONT 18 March 1738–20 November 1799
2 CONT https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LZ28-QV4/mary-mercy-morse-1738-1799
2 CONT Brief Life History of Mary Mercy
2 CONT When Mary Mercy Morse was born on 18 March 1738, in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, United States, her father, John Morse, was 40 and her mother, Jean Standly, was 38. She married Reuben Knowlton on 19 April 1765, in Wenham, Essex,
2 CONC  Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 20 November 1799, in Northport, Waldo, Maine, United States, at the age of 61.
