2 CONT Brief Life History of Isaac
2 CONT When Isaac Parker was born on 15 January 1663, in Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, John Parker, was 47 and his mother, Joanna, was 40. He married Mary Parker on 4 May 1687, in Newton, Midd
2 CONC lesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 2 daughters. He lived in Newton, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America in 1663. He died from 1693 to 17
2 CONC 54, in Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
