2 CONT ===Benjamin Parker (1662 - 1733)===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin Parker
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 29 Jan 1662 in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay, New England
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Benjamin Parker and Sarah (Hartwell) Parker
2 CONT
2 CONT [sibling(s) unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Mary Trull — married 11 Oct 1684 (to 15 Sep 1694) in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Abigail French — married 10 Nov 1697 in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Mary (Jones) Parker — married 23 Nov 1720 (to 23 Dec 1733) in Billerica, Middlesex Co., Massachusetts Bay Province
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Mary (Parker) Sweeney, Benjamin Parker and Abigail (Parker) Marshall
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 23 Dec 1733 in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay, New England
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT - Benjamin was born 29 Jun 1662 in Billerica, Massachusetts Bay Colony, New England, to parents Benjamin & Sarah (Hartwell) of Concord, Mass.[1][2][3][4][5]
2 CONT - Benjamin married 1st, 11 Oct 1684 in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts, Mary Trull [6][7][8], dau of John and Sarah French of Billerica, Mass. Children: Mary (1685-1748), Benjamin (1689- )
2 CONT - Benjamin married 2nd, 10 Nov 1697 in Billerica, Massachusetts, Abigail French [9][10], dau of John & Hannah Burrage [11]. Children: Abigail b. 11 Sep 1698; John b. 11 Dec 1700; Bethia b. 17 Sep 1705.
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband: Benjamin Parker
2 CONT Wife: Mary Trull
2 CONT Child: Benjamin Parker
2 CONT Marriage: [12]
