1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT John French, son of Joseph and Experience (Foster) French, was born on 30 Jan. 1671/2 at Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elizabeth.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Hannah.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT John died on 6 Sep. 1760 in his 91st year at Berkley, Bristol County, Massachusetts.[1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT His children were born at Taunton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John and Elizabeth
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth b. Oct. 1699. John b. May 1701. Experience b. Sep. 1705. Silence b. June 1707. Children of John and Hannah
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail b. 25 May 1711 Samuel b. 3 Dec. 1714. Israel b. 21 July 1717. Hannah b. 19 June 1720. Rachel b. 20 April 1723.[3]
2 CONT
