2 CONC ench) Phillips, Joseph French, Nathaniel French, Sarah French, Jacob French, Thomas French, Ebenezer French and Nathan French Husband of Elizabeth (Foster) French — married about 1697 in Scituate, Plymouth, Massachusetts Baymap DE
2 CONC SCENDANTS descendants Father of John French, Silence (French) Jenney, Abigail (French) Staples, Israel French and Hannah (French) Caswell Died 6 Sep 1760 in Berkley, Bristol County, Massachusettsmap Profile manager: Kenneth Kinman
