1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=73722153&ref=wvr
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mary Chillingsworth''' Born say 1643 in Marshfield, MA. Mary died on 25 Sep 1702 in Marshfield, MA. [318]
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:  Thomas Chillingworth (-1653) and Joane ? (1642-1684).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:
2 CONT # ca 1663 Mary married Dea. John Foster, son of Thomas Foster (ca 1612-20 Apr 1682) & Elizabeth [Foster] (-29 Jan 1694/5).[7] Born on 7 Oct 1642 in Weymouth, MA.87 John died in Marshfield, MA, on 3 Jun 1732; he was 89. Occupation:
2 CONC  blacksmith.
2 CONT
2 CONT John and Mary lived in Marshfield.7
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children include:
2 CONT # Elizabeth Foster (24 Sep 1664-26 Jun 1715)
2 CONT # Dea. John Foster (12 Oct 1666-24 Dec 1741)
2 CONT # Josiah Foster (7 Jun 1669-1757)
2 CONT # Mary Foster (13 Sep 1671-3 Apr 1750)
2 CONT # Joseph Foster (ca 1673-Apr 1750)
2 CONT # Sarah Foster (ca 1675/1678-7 Apr 1702)
2 CONT # Chillingsworth Foster (11 Jul 1680-22 Dec 1764)
2 CONT # James Foster (Died soon) (22 May 1683-21 Jul 1683)
2 CONT # Deborah Foster (ca 1685-4 Nov 1732)
2 CONT # Thomas Foster (ca 1686-6 Feb 1758)
2 CONT
