1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT === Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Foster-1471
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Foster was born on September 24, 1664 in Marshfield, Plymouth Colony. Her parents were John Foster and Mary Chillingworth.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married William Carver on January 18, 1682 
2 CONT
2 CONT Together they had 11 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # John Carver
2 CONT # William Carver
2 CONT # Josiah Carver
2 CONT # Caleb Carver
2 CONT # Mary Carver
2 CONT # Joshua Carver
2 CONT # Elizabeth Carver
2 CONT # Millicent Carver
2 CONT # Alanson Carver
2 CONT # Sarah Carver
2 CONT # Elizabeth Carver
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 26 June 1715, at age 51, in Marshfield.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # WikiTree contributors, "Elizabeth (Foster) Carver (1664-1715)," WikiTree: The Free Family Tree, (https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Foster-1471 : accessed 18 January 2026).
2 CONT # Carver, C. N. (1935).''The Carver family of New England: Robert Carver of Marshfield and his descendants.'' Searsport ME: Privately printed. p.55-56
