2 CONT
2 CONT Rachel Foster formerly Bassett was born on 25 Oct 1679 in Sandwich, Massachusetts to William Bassett III and Rachel (Williston) Bassett. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Joseph Foster 08 Sep 1696 at Sandwich[2]. Son of John Foster I and Mary Chillingworth.
2 CONT
