1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Chillingsworth Foster
2 CONT * FamilySearch Family Tree
2 CONT * Birth:	June 11 1680 - Marshfield, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America
2 CONT * Death:	Dec 22 1764 - Harwich, Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America
2 CONT * Parents: John Foster & Mary Chillingworth
2 CONT * Spouse: Mercy Freeman - married 1705 
2 CONT * Spouse: Susannah Gray - married 1721
2 CONT * Spouse: Ruth Merrick - married 14 October 1731
2 CONT * Children:	Jerusha Foster, Foster, Nathaniel Foster, Jerusha Bangs (born Foster), Thomas Foster, Foster, Mary Paddock (born Foster)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://mathcs.clarku.edu/~djoyce/gen/report/rr07/rr07_417.html#P14299
2 CONT
2 CONT Family of Mary Chillingsworth (6068) & Dea. John Foster:
2 CONT
2 CONT 16300. Chillingsworth Foster. Born on 11 Jul 1680 in Marshfield, MA.60 Chillingsworth died in Harwich, MA, on 22 Dec 1764; he was 84.
2 CONT
2 CONT Chillingsworth resided in Harwich, of which town he was many years Representative in the General Court.400
2 CONT Ca 1704/5 Chillingsworth first married Mercy Freeman (13838) , daughter of John Freeman (4732) (Dec 1651-27 Jul 1721) & Sarah Merrick (1 Aug 1654-21 Apr 1696). Born on 3 Aug 1687 in Eastham, MA.148 Mercy died in Harwich, MA, on 7 
2 CONC Jul 1720; she was 32.400
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Chillingsworth and Mercy (Freeman) Foster:
2 CONT #     i. James Foster, b. 6 Jan 1705/6, d. ca. 1778 at Athol, MA, m. 1st 10 Jul 1729 Lydia Winslow (d. 7 Jan 1770, dau. of Edward Winslow), m. 2nd 13 May 1771 Phebe Axtell;
2 CONT #     ii. Chillingsworth Foster, b. 25 Dec 1707, d. before 9 Jun 1779, m. at Rochester, MA, 10 Oct 1730 Mary Winslow (b. 1 Sep 1712, d. 25 Jan 1757, dau. of Edward Winslow);
2 CONT #     iii. Mary Foster, b. 5 Jan 1709/10, d. after 1763 at Southeast, Dutchess Co., NY, m. 12 Oct 1727 David Paddock (b. 12 Aug 1705 at Yarmouth, d. ca. 1772 at Southeast, son of Zachariah & Bethiah (Hall) Paddock);
2 CONT #     iv. Thomas Foster, b. 15 Mar 1711/2, m. at Harwich 11 Jul 1734 Mary Hopkins;
2 CONT #     v. Nathan Foster, b. 10 Jun 1715, m. at Harwich 14 Jun 1739 Sarah Lincoln;
2 CONT #     vi. Isaac Foster, b. 1718; and
2 CONT #     vii. Mercy Foster, b. & d. 1720.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT On 10 Aug 1721 when Chillingsworth was 41, he second married Susannah Gray, daughter of John Gray (Jul 1671-31 Mar 1732) & Susanna Clark (12 Mar 1673/4-10 Sep 1731), in Harwich, MA.400 Born 2 Mar 1693/4 in Harwich, MA. Susannah di
2 CONC ed in Harwich, MA on 7 Dec 1730. Susanna, widow of Nathaniel Sears.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Chillinsworth and Susanna (Gray) (Sears) Foster:
2 CONT #     i. Mercy Foster, b. 29 Jul 1722, m. 7 Oct 1742 Isaac Crosby;
2 CONT #     ii. Nathaniel Foster, b. 17 Apr 1725, d. afater 1763;
2 CONT #     iii. Jerusha Foster, b. 9 Dec 1727, d. after 1763; and
2 CONT #     iv. a sillborn son, b. 1730.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT On 7 Dec 1731 when Chillingsworth was 51, he third married Ruth Merrick (20496) , daughter of William Merrick (15 Sep 1643-30 Oct 1732) & Abigail Hopkins (7451) (Oct 1644-ca 1691), in Harwich, MA. Born ca 1684 in Eastham, MA. Ruth
2 CONC  died in Harwich, MA on 13 Feb 1766.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~wingfamilyofamerica/p459.htm#i2003327
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Susanna Gray Sears. Chillingworth was born at Marshfield, PC, on 11 June 1680. He died at Harwich, Barnstable, MA, on 22 December 1764. His body was interred at Harwich, Barnstable, MA, at Old Burial Ground. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Deacon Chillingworth Foster and Susanna Gray Sears
2 CONT # Nathaniel Foster+ b. 17 Apr 1725, d. c 1 May 1787
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
