1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Frost, son of James Frost and his wife Elizabeth Foster, was born on Oct 1667 in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts, and died 6 Mar 1742 at age 74 in Tewksbury, Middlesex, Massachusetts.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 3 times with children with each wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT >Thomas b Oct 18, 1667; m Rebecca Farley, Hannah Richardson, Deborah ____________ (C. Frost - p31)
2 CONT
2 CONT Récords show:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Middlesex/Billerica/aBirthsF.shtml "(Frost) Thomas, s. James and Elisabeth [dup. Elizabeth] [Elizabeth. MR], Oct. 18, 1667."
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Middlesex/Billerica/aMarriagesF.shtml "(Frost) Thomas [dup. Sr.] and Rebecca [dup. Rebeckah] Farley, Dec. 12, 1695.*"
2 CONT
2 CONT (2nd) https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Middlesex/Billerica/aMarriagesF.shtml "(Frost) Thomas and Hannah Richardson of Wooburn, Mar. 28, 1706, in Woburn.*"
2 CONT
2 CONT (3rd) Deborah [Farley?]  after May 1708 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Middlesex/Tewksbury/DeathsF.shtml "(Frost) Thomas, Mar. 6, 1742, in his 76th y."
2 CONT
2 CONT Billerica VR has Thomas with these children:
2 CONT * James, s. Thomas Sr. and Rebeckah [dup. Rebecca, second dup. Rebecka], Sept. 18, 1696. died Apr. 21, 1697.
2 CONT * Experiance, d. Thomas Sr. and Rebeckah [dup. Rebecca] Mar. 26, 1698. married in Andover, Joseph Bigby, June 12, 1723.
2 CONT * Rebeckah [dup. Rebecka], d. Thomas Sr. and Rebeckah [dup. Rebecca], Aug. 9, 1701. married, in Andover, (1) David Blanchard, Aug. 10, 1725. (2) Isaac Gray, Nov. 20, 1733.
2 CONT * Sarah, d. Thomas Sr. and Rebecca [dup. Rebeckah], Dec. 25, 1704. married, in Andover, Abraham Foster, Feb. 2, 1729-30.
2 CONT * Thomas, s. Thomas and Hannah, Apr. 16, 1708 [dup. 1728, sic] married Dorcas Boynton of Lunenburg, June 6, 1737, in Lunenburg.
2 CONT * Joseph, s. Thomas and Deborah, Nov. 26, 1709. married, in Andover, Mary Baxby, Feb. 21, 1733-4.
2 CONT * Timothy, s. Thomas and Deborah, Nov. 16, 1710. died June 8, 1714.
2 CONT * Deborah, d. Thomas and Deborah, June 9, 1714. 
2 CONT * Elizabeth [dup. Elisabeth], d. Thomas and Deborah, Feb. 28, 1716-17. ?married, in Tewksbury, John Pattin, May 28, 1741.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas b Oct 18, 1667; m Rebecca Farley, Hannah Richardson, Deborah ____________ (C. Frost - p31)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
