2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebeckah, daughter of Jacob Parker & Sarah Parker, was born on 29 March 1661 in Chelmsford, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony.[1] Rebecka married Jonathan Danforth on 27 April 1682 in Chelmsford, Middlesex, Massachusetts, United
2 CONC  States.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebeckah married Joseph Foster on 17 March 1754 in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts, United States.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebeckah died (age 94) on 25 March 1754 in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony.[4]
2 CONT
