1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT When Susanna Hill was born on 26 May 1715, in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts, United States, her father, Samuel Hill Sr, was 43 and her mother, Sarah Page, was 40. She married Joseph Patten on 8 January 1734, in Billerica, Mi
2 CONC ddlesex, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 2 daughters. She died in December 1752, at the age of 37.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT
