1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Patten-392
2 CONT
2 CONT Lucy (Patten) Moody (1735 - 1813)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Lucy Moody formerly Patten===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1 Dec 1735 in Billerica, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Joseph Patten and Susanna Hill
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Joseph Patten and Mehitable (Patten) Shaw
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Somerby Moody — married 12 Jul 1755 in Newbury, Middlesex, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Mary Moody
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 19 Jul 1813 at age 77 in Newburyport, Essex, Massachusetts, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 2 Aug 2021 | Created 22 Jul 2014
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Lucy Patten was born December 1, 1735 in Billerica, Middlesex County, Massachusetts, the daughter of Joseph Patten and Susanna Hill, the daughter of Samuel Hill.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Among the marriage intentions published in Newburyport, there is one of Somerby Moody and Lucy Patten, of Sheepscot, July 12, 1755.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
