2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Lucy (Patten) Moody and Joseph Patten
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Moses Shaw — married 24 Jan 1781 in Granville, Annapolis, Nova Scotia
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Susanna (Shaw) Reed and Anne (Shaw) Reid
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 3 Jul 1818 at age 73 in Granville, Richmond, Nova Scotia, Canada
2 CONT
