2 CONT
2 CONT Boxford VR has Jonathan & Rebecca with these children:
2 CONT * Israel,  s. Jonathan and Rebecca, Mar. 16. 1765. (from images) married Mehitible Carlton, Apr. 17, 1794.
2 CONT * Charles, s. Jonathan and Rebecca, Apr. 26, 1767. married (1) Lucy Austin of Andover, Mar. 20, 1796. (2) Mehitable Chandler, Nov. 18, 1807.
2 CONT * Betsy, d. Jonathan and Rebecca, Mar. 12, 1769. bp. Nov. 18, 1769. married Thomas Spafford, Nov. 9, 1791. 
2 CONT * Amassa, s. [Lt. CR2] Jonathan and Rebecca, May 8, 1771. Betsy Poor of Rowley, int. Oct. 1, 1792.
2 CONT * Jonathan, s. [Lt. CR2]Jonathan and Rebecca, Feb. 3, 1774. married Mary Kimball, Dec. 24, 1800.
2 CONT * Phinehas, s. Jonathan and Rebecca, July 27, 1776. removed to Boston. married, in Haverhill, Frances Harrod, Aug. 26, 1805.
