1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/b/u/t/Pamela-Butler/GENE4-0013.html
2 CONT
2 CONT 23. MARTHA3 LOWE (NANCY ANN2 BUTLER, EDMUND "E"1) was born Abt. 1779 in South Carolina, and died Abt. 1869 in Madison, Georgia/Family burying ground outside of Madison. She married SHERWOOD STANLEY. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for MARTHA LOWE:
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. Ray Palmer (Home town unknown). Descended from John Lowe through John's youngest daughter, Martha Lowe. He dicated notes on the Stanley family in 1921-1922, which was printed in "Family Puzzler" #568 in 1978. 
2 CONT
2 CONT More About MARTHA LOWE:
2 CONT
2 CONT Fact 3: Lived to over 90, usual intelligence.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fact 10: Dr. Ray Palmer, dictated notes in 1921-22 on Stanley family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Medical Information: Rheumatism
2 CONT
2 CONT Misc.: 1820, Named in her father's will as "Patsy" Stanley.
2 CONT
2 CONT Religion: Fine Christian.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About SHERWOOD STANLEY:
2 CONT
2 CONT Misc.: 1820, Named as executor in father-in-law's will.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARTHA LOWE and SHERWOOD STANLEY are: 
2 CONT
