1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Albena Stanley was born 1806 in Orange, NC, USA, and died 1880 in Mississippi, USA. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Thomas King Jr 1825 in Orange, NC, USA, son of Thomas King Sr and Elizabeth Waggoner. He was born 1805 in Orange, NC, USA, and died 1862 in Tippah County, Mississippi, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Albena Stanley and Thomas King Jr are:
2 CONT # Mary King was born 1826 in Franklin Tennessee.
2 CONT # Nancy King was born 1828 in Franklin Tennessee, and died bef. 1860 in Mississippi, USA.
2 CONT # Thomas King was born 1831 in Franklin Tennessee.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Ann King was born 7/19/1834 in Franklin Tennessee, and died 2/16/1884 in Tippah County, Mississippi, USA.
2 CONT # Narcisca Caroline King was born 10/14/1834 in Franklin Tennessee, and died June 1889 in Tippah County, Mississippi, USA.
2 CONT # Minerva King was born 1837 in Tippah County, Mississippi, USA. She married James Pulliam 1856 in Tippah County, Mississippi, USA. He was born 1831 in Tippah County, Mississippi, USA.
2 CONT # William Henry King was born 11/6/1838 in Tippah County, Mississippi, USA, and died 4/1/1899 in Brownfield, Mississippi USA.
2 CONT # John Stanley King was born 9/6/1840 in Tippah County, Mississippi, USA, and died 4/22/1913 in Tippah County, Mississippi, USA.
2 CONT # Lewis Hank King was born 1844 in Tippah County, Mississippi, USA, and died 7/2/1864 in Virginia, United States.
2 CONT # Allen Kendricks King was born 1848 in Tippah County, Mississippi, USA.
