1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Came to TX with his parents from South Carolina. Filed and received 4428.40 acres of land in Angelina County, TX. in 1848 he was appointed overseer of road building from the town of Marion to Bett Ferry on the Nech
2 CONC es River. He was Justice of the Peace for Old Homer, which was then the county seat of Angelina County. Became a close friend of Sam Houston, and even his oldest, Jim, remembered Houston visiting his family home many times. ------
2 CONC --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT  STEPHEN JEFFERSON2 STANLEY, JR.  (STEPHEN JEFFERSON1) was born 1813 in Mississippi Territoryor Alabama, and died April 30, 1883 in Houston County, Texas.  He married MARY ANN TALITHA CHEAIRS November 13, 1837 in San Augustine Co.
2 CONC , TX, daughter of JOHN CHEAIRS and ELENOR BITTICK..  She was born Bet. 1816 - 1819 in Arkansas, and died February 03, 1881 in Houston Co., Tx.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for STEPHEN JEFFERSON STANLEY, JR.:
2 CONT
2 CONT was Justice of the Peace in old Homer, Texas.  During the feuding days,
2 CONT
2 CONT one of his sons was killed in Homer before the county seat was moved
2 CONT
2 CONT to Lufkin, Tx.  I show Stephen born in Mississippi Territory and the 1850
2 CONT
2 CONT Angelina Co., TX census show that he was born in Mississippi.  The 1870
2 CONT
2 CONT census in Madison Co., TX shows him born in Alabama as well as the
2 CONT
2 CONT 1880 census where he lived in Dist. 28, Houston County, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen states that both of his parents were born in Georgia.  Children
2 CONT
2 CONT that I have for his family were chosen from those census and also the
2 CONT
2 CONT book on the History of Angelina Co., TX.  I show Stephen died on April 30, 1883,
2 CONT
2 CONT and is buried near Crockett, Houston Co., TX.  Another researcher stated that
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen Jefferson Stanley, Jr. was also married to Mary Elizabeth Cherry and 
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha M. "Mattie" Leatherwood. Since S. J. Stanley and M. A. Stanley appear
2 CONT
2 CONT on the 1880 Houston Co., TX Census, I don't see how he had 2 other wives. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen and family were living next door to Calvin J. Horton and wife,
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Stanley, who was Stephen and Mary's daughter.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1850 Census Angelina Co., TX page 76
2 CONT
2 CONT #113 #113
2 CONT
2 CONT S. J. Stanley age 37 b Mississippi
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary age 31 b AR
2 CONT
2 CONT James age 9 b TX
2 CONT
2 CONT Eliza age 8 b TX
2 CONT
2 CONT William age 7 b TX
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen age 4 b TX
2 CONT
2 CONT Sariah age 2 b TX
2 CONT
2 CONT Tennessee age 3 months (f) TX
2 CONT
2 CONT William Smith living in household
2 CONT
2 CONT 1870 Census Madison Co., TX page 327
2 CONT
2 CONT #236 #239
2 CONT
2 CONT Steven Stanly w/m farmer age 57 b Ala
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary A. age 54 b Ark
2 CONT
2 CONT Jefferson 28 b TX
2 CONT
2 CONT Tennessee 19 b TX
2 CONT
2 CONT George W. 17 TX
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary A. 16 TX
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret 12 TX
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph 8 TX
2 CONT
2 CONT Sam Chears 23 b TX works on farm
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathan Burke 24 b TX works on farm
2 CONT
2 CONT (daughter Sarah is living next door #237) married to Calvin J. Horton, SR. my husband's great grandparents).
2 CONT
2 CONT 1880 Census Houston Co., TX page 400
2 CONT
2 CONT S. J. Stanley age 69 b AL father and mother b Georgia
2 CONT
2 CONT M. A. Stanley age 66 b AR father b TN mother b M? (MO not sure)
2 CONT
2 CONT J. P. Stanley age 18 b TX father b AL mother b AR (This is their son Joseph)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of STEPHEN STANLEY and MARY CHEAIRS are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 	i.	JAMES WILMETH3 STANLEY, b. Abt. 1841, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT 	ii.	ELIZA STANLEY, b. Abt. 1842.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.	iii.	WILLIAM GREEN "UNCLE IKE" STANLEY, b. December 23, 1845, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT 	iv.	STEPHEN JEFFERSON STANLEY III, b. Abt. 1846.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.	v.	SARAH ANN STANLEY, b. February 14, 1848, Texas; d. July 06, 1914, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT 	vi.	TENNESSEE STANLEY, b. March 1850, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT 	vii.	GEORGE W. STANLEY, b. Abt. 1853, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.	viii.	MARY ANN "MANK" STANLEY, b. Abt. 1855, Texas; d. September 1942.
2 CONT
2 CONT 	ix.	MARGARET STANLEY, b. Abt. 1858, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT 	x.	JOSEPH P. STANLEY, b. Abt. 1862, Texas.
