2 CONT vi. Sarah2 MARSHALL Sarah2 was born on 14 February 1654 in Reading, Middlesex co., MA[21]. On 15 July 1674 when Sarah2 was 20, she married Ebinezur STOCKER, in Lynn, Essex co., MA[65]. They had eight children, surnamed STOCKER.
