2 CONT WIFE/WIVES OF RICHARD I:
2 CONT ======================
2 CONT Based on his will, it is known that Richard remarried after his wife
2 CONT Ann/Anna died in 1656, evidently to a widow with two children (unfortunately there is no mention of this wife's name). However, there is also a distinct possibility that Richard was actually married to three different spouses! I h
2 CONC ave been unable to document any name other than that of Ann/Anna, but various researchers have come up with at least three different names; 1) from a citation in a 1992 IGI - "Richard Woody: birt 1615 at Roxbury, Suffolk, Massachu
2 CONC setts, son of ANN WINFORD and RICHARD WOODY"; 2) ANN DANN (or DAUN), w/note: "It is thought her father wasn't living-since her mother gave permission for marriage"; 3) MARY ANN HAYLE (or HALE).
2 CONT
2 CONT CHILDREN OF RICHARD I & ANN/ANNA:
2 CONT =================================
2 CONT 2. Richard Woody II, born ca. 1615 in England; died ca. 21 Apr
2 CONT 1681 in Massachusetts. He married Frances Dexter 29 Dec 1646 in Roxbury, Suffolk Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Mary Woody, born ca. 1617 in England; died 30 Jun 1662 in Massachusetts. She married Edmund Sheffield II 17 Apr 1644 in Roxbury, Suffolk Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. John Woody, born ca. 1629 in England; died 23 Mar 1650 in Roxbury, Suffolk Co., Massachusetts. He married Mary Coggan ca. 1648 in Roxbury, Suffolk Co., Massachusetts.
2 CONT
