2 CONT Husband of Mary (Cogan) Robinson — married about 1648 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of John Woody Jr. and Isaac Woody
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 23 May 1649 at about age 20 in Roxbury, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 5 Sep 2019 | Created 26 May 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT Boston Records Commissioners Reports (Rockwell and Churchill, Boston, 1875) Vol. 6.
2 CONT Page 174: Roxbury Church Records. "1650 Month ye 3d day 23. John Wooddie, a christian & godly brother dyed of ye small pox."
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
