1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Edmund SHEFFIELD, son of Edmund Sheffield (d 1631) & Thomasine, was christened on 6 Aug 1612 in All Saint's, Sudbury, Suffolk, England. Edmund settled in Braintree, Mass., where he died 13 Oct. 1705, "aged about 90
2 CONC  years". He had issue eleven (SIC: twelve) children.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===family===
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund married 3 times.
2 CONT
2 CONT His '''first wife''', of whom nothing is known, probably died in England before he emigrated. Their daughter was
2 CONT
2 CONT * Elizabeth, baptized at All Saint's in Sudbury, Suffolk, England on 12 March 1635/6.  She probably died young, as no record of her in New England has been found.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
