1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Edmund Sheffield''' was born in 1580 in Sudbury, Suffolk, England.1
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Thomas Sheffield.1 The name of his mother is not known.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 
2 CONT # About 1607 to Thomasine (unknown). in England.1,2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Edmund Sheffield and Thamazine unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT #     Humphrey Sheffield1 (30 Nov 1608 - )
2 CONT #     Thamazine Sheffield1 (17 Jul 1610 - )
2 CONT #     Edmund Sheffield+1 (16 Aug 1612 - 13 Oct 1705)
2 CONT #     William Sheffield+1 (15 Nov 1619 - 6 Dec 1700)
2 CONT #     Tomson Sheffield1 (12 Mar 1624 - )
2 CONT #     Elizabeth Sheffield1 (12 Mar 1624 - )
2 CONT #     Amos Sheffield1 (Dec 1627 - 31 Dec 1708)
2 CONT #     Ichabod Sheffield1 (23 Dec 1630 - 4 Feb 1711/12)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From The New England Historical and Genealogical Register, Volumes 76-77. Genealogical Gleanings in England: [https://books.google.com/books?id=FpAeAQAAMAAJ&lpg=RA1-PA192&ots=S06hVx7Ogb&dq=thomasine%20sheffield&pg=RA1-PA192#v=onep
2 CONC age&q=thomasine%20sheffield&f=true page 192] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Edmund Died before 4 Jan 1630/1, when administration on his estate was granted to his son Humphrey.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
