1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Find A Grave Index," database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:QVVB-PSYR : 13 December 2015), George Washington Jones, 1929; Burial, Upward, Henderson, North Carolina, United States of Americ
