2 PLAC Newport Parish
2 ADDR
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY Colonial America
1 BURI
2 DATE AFT 19 NOV 1722
2 ADDR
3 CITY Isle of Wight
3 STAE Virginia
3 CTRY United States
