2 DATE 19 NOV 1722
2 ADDR
3 STAE Province of Virginia
1 OCCU Carpenter & Farmer
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was not the son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Capt-William-Fuller-Colonial-Gov-of-Maryland/6000000001532096436?through=6000000065769645009 Gov. William Fuller].  John Beattie Fuller, below, suggests that his f
2 CONC ather was immigrant Samuel Fuller who was transported to Isle of Wight County before 1667 under the sponsorship of Robert Coleman.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born between 1770-1780. Married c. 1799. Will dated 19 Nov 1722 in Isle of Wight County.
2 CONT
2 CONT See ''Ezekiel Fuller: Isle of Wight County, Virginia...'' by John Beattie Fuller, 2008, available online at https://www.familysearch.org/library/books/records/item/477737-redirection
2 CONT
2 CONT Lists children (all born Newport Parish, Isle of Wight County, VA) as:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Henry 1700-1765 Granville Co, NC m. Sarah Unknown c 1739; children Henry, Sarah, Shadrack, Joseph and Meshack
2 CONT # Ezekiel 1701-1763 Granville Co, NC m. Sarah Vinson c 1724; children Honor, Lydia, Mourning, Sarah, Unity, Ezekiel, Benjamin, Elizabeth, Mary, Henry, Samuel
2 CONT # Martha 1702 then m. Mr. Whitley
2 CONT # Solomon 1703-1777 Granville Co, NC m. Mary Jones c 1728; children: Israel, Barnaby, Jones, Solomon, Mary, Millie, Ann, Britain, Lucretia, John
2 CONT # John 1704-1810 Columbia Co, GA m. Mary Warner bef 1738; children: William, Elijah, Isham, Joshua, Stephen, Isaac, John, Uriah
2 CONT # Honour 1706- m. Thomas James Allen; children Arthur, Thomas, Ann, Honor
2 CONT # Ann 1707- then m. Mr. Bass
2 CONT # Mary 1709- then m. Mr. Bailey
2 CONT # Benjamin 1710-aft. 1761 Granville Co, NC m. Elizabeth Duke c 1730; children: Zachariah, Christian, Rachel, Sally, Tamar, Britain, Joseph
2 CONT # Arthur 1718-bef Oct 14, 1797 Pittsylvania Co, VA
2 CONT # Joseph 1720-bef 1790 SC? m. Unknown; Children: Thomas, Joseph, Alexander, Archibald
2 CONT # Timothy 1722-bef Jan 27, 1767 Bute (Warren) Co, NC m. Elizabeth Vinson c 1750; children David, Arthur
2 CONT
2 CONT =------------------------------------=
2 CONT May have died 24 June 1723
2 CONT
2 CONT Isle of Wright, Virginia, USA
2 CONT
