1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/MY2S-8HC
2 CONT Brief Life History of Mary Ann'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Spivey was born about 1678, in Chowan, North Carolina, United States as the daughter of Thomas Spivey and Mary Spivey. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She had at least 5 sons and 7 daughters with William Hill. 
2 CONT Moses Hill 1699-1750
2 CONT Aaron Hill 1700-1761
2 CONT Sarah Hill 1704-1755
2 CONT Jacob Hill 1704-
2 CONT William Hill (1) 1706- [died in infancy]
2 CONT William Hill (2) 1709-
2 CONT Mary Hill 1710-1770
2 CONT Susanna Hill 1712-1778
2 CONT Rachael Hill 1714-
2 CONT Ruth Hill 1716-1780
2 CONT Leah Hill 1718-1769
2 CONT
2 CONT She died after 1752, in her hometown.
