1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.geneajourney.com/spivey.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thomas Spivey and Mary Hill were:
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Jacob Spivey'' [b] b abt 1697, Upper Parish, Nansemond, VA, d aft 18 Nov 1776, Chowan, NC. He md Ann abt 1720. She was b abt 1700.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Jacob Spivey and Ann were:
2 CONT # Ann Spivey b abt 1721; md Unknown Walton.
2 CONT # Jacob Spivey b abt 1722.
2 CONT # Abraham Spivey b abt 1724, of Chowan, NC; md Rachel Hill 1 Mar 1748.
2 CONT # Jesse Spivey b abt 1726, of Chowan, NC; md Mary Blanchard 5 Nov 1758.
2 CONT # Melicent Spivey b abt 1727, of Chowan, NC.
2 CONT # Thomas Spivey b abt 1729, of Chowan, NC.
2 CONT # William Spivey b abt 1732, of Chowan, NC.
2 CONT # Ruth Spivey b abt 1733, of Chowan, NC; md Unknown Walton.
2 CONT # Emily Spivey b abt 1736, of Chowan, NC.
2 CONT
2 CONT b. The will abstract of Jacob Spivey:
2 CONT
2 CONT Spivey, Jacob, Chowan, Nov 18th, 1776. Sons Thomas, William and Abraham, sons Jesse and Jacob, daughters Ruth Walton, Rachel, Millicent, Emily and Ann Walton, wife Ann, sons Thomas and Abraham Exrs. Test Aaron Hill, Moses Hill, Mo
2 CONC ses Blanshard
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT From an abstract of his will:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://archive.org/stream/abstractofnorthc01nort/abstractofnorthc01nort_djvu.txt
2 CONT
2 CONT Spivey, Thomas. Chowan Precinct. 
2 CONT *December 23, 1729. 
2 CONT *February 5, 1729-1730. 
2 CONT *Sons: 
2 CONT **Jacob (plantation) and 
2 CONT **Benjamin, 
2 CONT **William and 
2 CONT **Thomas (12 pence and a Bible). 
2 CONT *Son-in-law: William Hill (90 acres land). 
2 CONT *Daughter: Mary Hill. 
2 CONT *Grandchildren: 
2 CONT **Jacob Spivey, 
2 CONT **Sarah, Mary and Susanah Hill. 
2 CONT *Other legatee:  Marke Chapel.
2 CONT * Executor: Jacob Spivey (son). 
2 CONT *Witnesses: 
2 CONT **William Westton, 
2 CONT **Robart Blanch and
2 CONT **Thomas Mansfield. 
2 CONT *Proven before Richard Everard. 
