1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.    Thomas1 Bass, born 13 November 1687, married Martha Willis on 22 June 1724. She died during the childbirth of their second son Thomas, and he married second, Tamer Spivey on 2 May 1729. He was taxable in the household of his
2 CONC  father William1 Bass from 1730 to 1736. Thomas and his wife Tamer may have left the county before 1750 since they were not included in the tax lists from 1750 to 1766. They sold land in Norfolk County on 17 June 1756 [Bell, Bass 
2 CONC Families of the South, 52]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
