2 CONT Obituary: Rev.Joseph B. Brantley, Detroit pastor Services for the Rev. Joseph B. Brantley of Detroit will be at 1 1 a.m. Friday at Galilee Missionary Baptist Church, 14201Arlington, Detroit. Mr. Brantley, 68, was pastor of the chu
2 CONC rch. He died Friday at Northwest General Hospital, Detroit. He received an honorary doctorate degree in 1972 from New Era Baptist Seminary. Mr. Brantley is survived by his wife, Cenobia; two sons, Michael and Gordon; a daughter, P
2 CONC amela; six grandchildren;two brothers, and a sister. Visitation will be from 1 1 a.m. to 8 p.m. Thursday at the church. Burial will be in Woodlawn Cemetery, Detroit. Arrangements were handled by Pope Funeral Home, Detroit. - Detro
2 CONC it Free Press, Friday, March 2 1984.
2 CONT
