2 CONT Birth: 	Dec. 27, 1764 Yorktown York County Virginia, USA Death: 	1804 Williamsburg Williamsburg City Virginia, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Nelson was the 2nd son, and eldest to have surviving male issue; he married in 1795, Francis, 3rd daughter and 7th child of Governor John Page and Francis (called Fannie) Burwell, his wife. (Ref: Genealogy of the Page Famil
2 CONC y of Virginia)
2 CONT
2 CONT The children of Thomas and Francis Nelson were: 1. Thomasia Nelson, born about 1796; married 1821, Bishop William Meade, of the Episcopal Church, Va., and was his second fie. She was buried in The Fork Church graveyard, Hanover Co
2 CONC ., Va. 2. Fannie Nelson, born about 1798; died unmarried. 3. Thomas Nelson, born abour 1800; died unmarried. 4. Rev. George Washington Nelson, born March 2, 1800; married, about 1835, Jane E. Crease, of Alexandria, Va., and was he
2 CONC r first husband. She was born on Oct 31, 1816 and died Jul 3, 1878 and buried in East End Cemetery, Wytheville, Va. He died February 20, 1840. 
2 CONT
