1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Info added per DAR's "Lineage Book of the Charter Members" by Mary S Lockwood and published 1895
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Oct. 3, 1780 Yorktown York County Virginia, USA Death: 	Jan. 8, 1850 Frederick Frederick County Maryland, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan is the 8th child of Governor Thomas Nelson, Jr., and Francis Page is the 5th son of Governor John Page. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On April 10, 1835, Susanna wrote a letter to Lucy Calthorpe Smith Diggs, giving a biography of her mother, Lucy Grymes Nelson (1743-1830)(This letter is available in Colonial Williamsburg - Special Collections - Papers of Dr. Augu
2 CONC stine Smith (post 1769-1805) of Yorktown, Virginia, a friend of Thomas Nelson, and of his daughter, Lucy Calthorpe Smith, who married Ralph Wormeley Digges). 
2 CONT
