2 CONT
2 CONT COLONIAL FAMILIES OF THE SOUTHERN STATES OF AMERICA by Stella Pickett Hardy, p. 120
2 CONT Elizabeth Wormley(sic), a Revolutionary heroine.  She saved the Communion Silver of the Parish Church from capture by Tarleton and his men.
