2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Combs was born on February 7, 1761, in Frederick, Virginia, his father, John, was 25 and his mother, Nancy, was 19. He had six brothers and one sister. He died on April 27, 1848, in Washington, Kentucky, having lived a l
2 CONC ong life of 87 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''== Biography =='''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Soldier John" Combs was a Revolutionary War Soldier who was with General Washington at Valley Forge.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He belonged to the company commanded by Capt. Jonathan Langlin and he thinks Ensign Slaughter Haftern and the company of Capt. Benjamin Casey - Field Officers, Col. James Wood, Lieut. Col. Neville, Gen. Scott, and Maj. Jonathan Cl
2 CONC ark...
2 CONT
2 CONT '''He received wounds in his neck and leg in the war.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000191609568826&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
