2 CONC itage Family Trees] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 15 2014, 16:42:09 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=ourtexasfamily&id=I22120
