2 CONT
2 CONT Cynthia Stacy was born on 30 June 1746, in Overwharton Parish, Stafford, Virginia, United States, her father, Simon Stacy, was 31 and her mother, Judith Tolson, was 27. She married William Combs, Sr. on 2 December 1760, in Frederi
2 CONC ck, Virginia, United States. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 1 daughter. She died in 1805, in Russell, Virginia, United States, at the age of 59.
