1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Benjamin Stacy, II''' was born circa 1763 in Frederick, VA, United States and was baptized on March 15, 1767 in Gloucester, Massachusetts. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-63074679 Benjamin Stacy, I] and [https://
2 CONC www.geni.com/profile-47908186 Ann Stacy]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin married [https://www.geni.com/profile-25986394 Barbara Stacy] on December 24, 1798 in Lincoln, Kentucky, USA. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34647579264 Nancy Beth Combs]; [https:/
2 CONC /www.geni.com/profile-34718087019 Nancy Angeline Boyd (Stacy)]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34660129090 Jesse Stacy]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on March 10, 1856 in Breathitt, KY, United States. 
2 CONT ----
