2 CONT Jeremiah Combs was the son of Mason
2 CONT and Dorothy Combs. He was born in
2 CONT Russell, Moccasin Creek, Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Charity 'Rhodes' in 1810 in
2 CONT Warren Co., Tennessee.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jeremiah was the father of 10 children:
2 CONT Nancy
2 CONT John David
2 CONT Emeline
2 CONT Tennessee Ann
2 CONT Mason C
2 CONT Sarah
2 CONT William Buford
2 CONT Wheeling
2 CONT Coumbus M.
2 CONT Jessie Rhodes
2 CONT
2 CONT Jeremiah was a farmer in the 1850 Madison
2 CONT County, Arkansas census.
