1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Fleming & his wife Nancy Combs raised 13 children: 1) Alfred Patton 1813-1859, 2) William Logue 1816-1913, 3) Charlotte E. Hitchcock 1819-1909, 4) Louisa 1822-1908, 5) Tabitha 1824-1825, 6) James Monroe 1826-1
2 CONC 886, 7) Ozias Denton 1829-1903, 8) Amanda Passons 1832-1916 9) John Wesley 1835-1856, 10) Samuel Logan 1838-1918, 11) Jane 1838-1894, 12) Martha C. Walling 1841-1930, 13) Jerimiah "Jerry" Monroe 1844-1915.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Tennessee, married John Fleming 1812. They had 13 children.  Married Wm. Neal in 1861.  Went to Texas with her son Samuel Fleming in Oct.,1874. Died in 1881 and buried Osborn Ranch (originally Samuel's farm) about 1 mile w
2 CONC est of present Babyhead Cemetery.  
