1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: The dates of the vital statistics were "guestimated".
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Meade was the daughter of David Meade and Susannah Everard. She married George Walker and had several children. Three were documented by the DAR (and there were others):
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob Walker married Nancy Hawkins John Walker married Sallie Caffery George Walker married Rachel Caffery
2 CONT
2 CONT The actual burial site of Mary Meade Walker has been lost to history. Nevertheless, we have placed a Memorial Stone in her honor in the Cantrell Gilliand Memorial Garden.
2 CONT
2 CONT bio by Vonnie L. Cantrell
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT A descendant of Jacob Wythe Walker, Mary's youngest child, said she died shortly after Jacob's birth in Sep 1778, and before her husband, whose will was probated in Dec. 1781, so our best guess is that she died between late 1778 a
2 CONC nd 1881.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Meade Walker and Col. George Walker include:
2 CONT
2 CONT Kidder Keith Walker, b. 1754 Susannah Everard Walker Eldridge Rep. David Walker (1763-1820) Mary Walker Stith Anne Walker Randolph Sen. George Walker Margaret Walker Temple Frances(?Courtenay) Walker Helen Walker Call Andrew Meade
2 CONC  Walker John Walker (1772-1838) Jacob Wythe Walker (1778-1838)
2 CONT
