1 CONT
1 CONT <<Shadrack on the St. Mary's 1815-1824. On 25 January 1814, at FortMitchell in Spanish Florida, Shadrack Stanley [sic] was among the 105"Citizens of the District of Elotchaway In the Republic of East Florida"who signed a petition 
1 CONC to Congress for admission into the Union. Includedin the signers were other names associated with Shadrack Standley andTattnall County, Georgia: McKeene Green, Enoch Daniel, George Henderson,Ezekiel Stafford and James Stafford. 
