1 CONT 11. Thomas Cotton STANDLEY was born about 1836 in FL. He was ill withKidney stone in Jan 1849 in Alachua , FL. A bill for medical servicesfor Thomas C. Standley was paid from the estate of Jesse Standley toJames G. Dell, MD, for v
1 CONC isits and attendance January 12 through 31, 1849,including introduction of a catheter and an operation on January 23 for astone in the urethra. Total of the bill was $72.00. He appeared on thecensus in 1850 in Alachua County, FL. 
1 CONC In 1850 Alachua Co. FL census,Thomas Cotton Standley was listed as 14 years old; lived in household ofhis mother and step-father, Thomas Prevatt. He appeared on the census in1860 in Marion County, FL. In 1860 Marion Co., FL, the T
1 CONC homas C.Standley household consisted of: 
1 CONT
1 CONT
