1 CONT Mary H. 23 b. GA 
1 CONT Seaborn 3 b. FL 
1 CONT David 2 b. FL He wasburied in Plummer Cemetery, Levy County, FL. Information on ElizabethStandley and John B. Standley, children of Thomas C. and Mary Standley,provided by Barbara Wilson Krause. 
