0 @N6000000003263421114@ NOTE It is reported by some family memnbers, but unproved, that the third son's name was William. According to one researcher William came to the States but stayed only five years, then returned to Ireland. 
1 CONT
1 CONT Again speculation, this William may have moved to England and settled in the textile district of Bethnal Green near London. The father of Bob Rosamond (Bob is currently living in Nottingham, England, UK-his father deceased) traced
1 CONC  his family line back to a William Rosamond, and their family has the same tradition of being descended from a Huguenot refugee at the time of the revocation of the Edict of Nantes as does my own, and that of Mary Jane Loya.
