1 CONT
1 CONT Third child and eldest daughter of Captain John and Sarah (Scott) Stanley, born in Farmington, February 18, 1651-2, married July 14, 1670, Joseph, son of Walter and Mary (Stebbins) Gaylord of Windsor, who was born May 13, 1649. He
1 CONC  was one of the first settlers of Waterbury, having an eighty pound property; was collector of minister's rates in 1698, 1699, and 1700. His lot was on the corner of East and Main streets, next to John Stanley's. He removed in 170
1 CONC 7 to Durham, where be died in 1711. 
1 CONT
1 CONT           Their children were: 
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT    29  SARAH GAYLORD, b. July 11, 1671, 
1 CONT    m. Thomas Judd April 11, 1688. Their son, 
1 CONT      Joseph Judd, b. April 21, 1701, 
1 CONT      m. Elizabeth Royce Nov. 30, 1726. Their son, 
1 CONT        Isaac Judd, b. Nov. 18, 1727, 
1 CONT        m. Anna Williams Jan. 23, 1752. Their daughter,
1 CONT         Millee Judd, b. Oct. 24, 1769, 
1 CONT         m. Israel Perkins 1788. Their daughter, 
1 CONT           Leonora Perkins, b. Nov. 14, 1791, 
1 CONT           m. Isaac Warren Sept. 17, 1812. Their son, 
1 CONT             ISRAEL PERKINS WARREN, b. April 8, 1814, 
1 CONT              m. JANE STANLEY STOW Aug. 25, 1841 (No. 675). 
1 CONT    30  JOSEPH GAYLORD, b. April 22, 1673; m. Mary Hickok of 
1 CONT            Woodbury; removed to Durham and Wallingford. 
1 CONT    31  JOHN GAYLORD, b. April 21, 1677; removed with his 
1 CONT            brothers to Durham and Wallingford. 
1 CONT    32  WILLIAM GAYLORD, b. (???), (???); m. rst, Joanna (???
1 CONT            and 2d, Mercy (???); removed to Woodbury, and 
1 CONT            afterward to New Milford, where he died about 1753. 
1 CONT    33  BENJAMIN GAYLORD, lived in Durham. 
1 CONT    34  ELIZABETH GAYLORD, m. Joseph Hickok. 
1 CONT    35  MARY GAYLORD, m. March 4, 1701--2, Stephen Welto
1 CONT            d. 1709. 
1 CONT    36  ABIGAIL GAYLORD, bap. Nov. 7, 1686; m. James Williams. 
1 CONT    37  JOANNA GAYLORD, m. Robert Royce of Wallingford. 
1 CONT            (See above under Sarah Gaylord.) 
1 CONT    38  RUTH GAYLORD, m. Stephen Hickok; lived in Durham. 
1 CONT
